@startuml
title API console — login
actor Operator
participant "API console" as CLI
participant SmurfsApiClient as Client
participant "Smurfs.API account endpoint" as API
Operator -> CLI : Enter email and hidden password
CLI -> Client : LoginAsync(email, password)
Client -> Client : Clear previous token
Client -> API : POST /api/account/login
alt valid credentials
  API --> Client : Account information and token
  Client -> Client : Validate response and retain token in memory
  Client --> CLI : ApiUser (no token)
  CLI --> Operator : Signed-in confirmation
else invalid credentials
  API --> Client : 401
  Client --> CLI : ApiException (401)
  CLI --> Operator : Failure and another login prompt
end
@enduml
